This script was created to remove all mail profiles from control panel on a workstation post email cutover instead of using Bittitan DMA Tool

Next steps will be to create an AMP for INC so we may deploy it at a scheduled time as DMA does

It will perform the following
	Create a directory for registry backup to point to
	Backup the registry to above location defined
	Remove all mail profiles in the registry
	
A command is included to restore the registry should you need to using the above backup file

The result will be for Outlook to automatically prompt a user to build a new profile when first opened

Local OST data will remain intact at its original location

Advising a custom naming standard in the instructions for rebuilding the profile to end users will avoid duplicate names (matching a profile name already used)


	